{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan review PASSED (attestation signed, `verified_at_sha` 9c6dcfda7932...); claimed and\nimplemented. Change pushed for review as Gerrit 2343, commit b76ffae4bd15.\n\nThe one non-blocking advisory (T7/E6) asked whether the section's existing \"This checkout has\nthe Serena MCP server configured\" sentence should be edited rather than left beside the\nappended paragraph. Recorded decision: leave it, additions-only, for two reasons. First, the\nexisting sentence says the MCP server is *configured for* this checkout, which remains true —\nit does not claim Serena *indexes* this checkout, so it is not contradicted by the new\nparagraph, which supplies the missing fact about what Serena reads. Second, the change was\nscoped by the operator to state the mirror and the lag and nothing else; rewording adjacent\nguidance is outside that scope. The advisory was triaged `defer` (priority 0.42 vs a 0.95\nblock line).\n\nGates run in the change's own worktree, all green: `make lint` rc=0, `make typecheck` rc=0\n(683 files), `pytest tests/unit/test_module_size_contract.py` 4 passed,\n`check_complexity_baseline.py --check` `new=0 increased=0`. All six acceptance-criteria proofs\nreturned their stated values (section-scoped counts 1/1/1; `AGENTS.md` the only changed file;\n0 deletions; 0 out-of-scope matches).\n\nOperational note for the record: the rebar MCP endpoint was hard-down for roughly ten minutes\nmid-task (`/mcp` returning no response while Gerrit on the same host stayed HTTP 200). The\nlocal CLI could not substitute for the claim — the plan-review attestation is environment-bound\nand the CLI rejected it as `foreign_key` — so the claim waited for the endpoint to recover\nrather than being forced. No force override was used anywhere in this ticket."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787952336195365505,"uuid":"d1308b99-0544-4039-8375-803338f3f53e"}